call_translation = "Greetings legal entity. On behalf of yours truly, I would like to inquire upon a transfer of funds to the account: 348957. Recognize that this is an opportunity to invest into me, and become a stakeholder in the future of the younger generation, me. My reputation of an intergalactic wunderkind should be all you need to authenticate my assertions of godhood and supreme genius. Merci and goodbye."
